WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.628
The experiments deliberately sweep across scales.

00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:04.914
At the small end,

00:00:04.994 --> 00:00:12.936
two-dimensional synthetic von Mises mixtures let
the authors compute ground-truth local dimension exactly.

00:00:13.016 --> 00:00:18.157
In the middle, StyleGAN2-ADA and an iDDPM diffusion
model on CIFAR10.

00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:21.714
At the large end, Stable Diffusion version 1.5,

00:00:21.794 --> 00:00:28.221
where they study 86 verbatim-memorized LAION images
against thousands of non-memorized

00:00:28.301 --> 00:00:30.870
images drawn from LAION Aesthetics,

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.140
COCO, and the Tuxemon dataset.
